-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §16 תוספת עוז לתמורה: a teacher to whom
-- the reform applies in full is paid, from that school year, a supplement
-- of 42% on the combined salary and the 2001 and 2008 supplements; it is a
-- separate component that counts for the hour value, severance, the pension
-- and training funds and the percentage supplements on the combined salary
-- save five; and the 1987 and 1994 supplements grow by 42% of their value
-- on the eve of the signing.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `16 תוספת עוז לתמורה`

§§ `16(א)`

-- (א): a teacher (§4(ב)), a role holder among them, to whom the reform is
-- applied in full is entitled, from the school year in which it was so
-- applied to him, to a wage supplement of 42%, computed on the combined
-- salary, the 2001 supplement and the 2008 supplement: "תוספת עוז
-- לתמורה". How far the reform reaches him in a school year is §§5–8's;
-- the rule asks it of the year. (A principal's pay is part ה's.)
@ref akn:art_16__para_a
`the Oz LaTmura supplement rate` MEANS 42%

GIVEN e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the Oz LaTmura supplement` e IF
    e EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`

GIVEN e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the combined salary` IS A NUMBER @desc the teacher's own, at his position
      `the 2001 supplement` IS A NUMBER
      `the 2008 supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement for` e `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement` IS
    IF `entitled to the Oz LaTmura supplement` e
    THEN `the Oz LaTmura supplement rate` TIMES (`the combined salary` PLUS `the 2001 supplement` PLUS `the 2008 supplement`)
    ELSE 0

§§ `16(ב)`

-- (ב): the supplement is paid as a separate salary component and is
-- brought into account for the hour value, for severance pay under the
-- Severance Pay Law, for contributions to a pension provident fund and to
-- a training fund, and for the percentage supplements computed on the
-- combined salary — save the 2001 and 2008 supplements, the 2011 supplement
-- (§38), the 2011 erosion supplement (§39) and the promotion-grade
-- supplement (§20). The list of purposes is closed (convention
-- reading.closed-list): the Dafna fund is not among them, where §§20(ז),
-- 38(ג) and 39(ב) name it for their own supplements.
@ref akn:art_16__para_b
`the Oz LaTmura supplement is a separate salary component` MEANS TRUE

GIVEN p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement counts for` p IF
        p EQUALS `computing the hour value`
    OR p EQUALS `Oz severance pay under the Severance Pay Law`
    OR p EQUALS `contributions to a pension provident fund`
    OR p EQUALS `contributions to a training fund`
    OR p EQUALS `computing another percentage supplement on the combined salary`

§§ `16(ג)`

-- (ג): the 1987 and 1994 supplements paid to a teacher under (א) are
-- increased at a rate of 42% "ביחס לערכם השיקלי ערב חתימת הסכם זה": the
-- increase is 42% of each one's shekel value on the eve of the signing
-- (13.8.2011), the base the sentence names (convention amounts.base), and
-- it is added to what the supplement would be without it.
@ref akn:art_16__para_c
GIVEN e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the supplement without the increase` IS A NUMBER  @desc the 1987 or the 1994 supplement as it would be paid without (ג)
      `its value on the eve of the signing` IS A NUMBER  @desc its shekel value on 13.8.2011
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 16(ג)` e `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing` IS
    IF `entitled to the Oz LaTmura supplement` e
    THEN `the supplement without the increase` PLUS `the Oz LaTmura supplement rate` TIMES `its value on the eve of the signing`
    ELSE `the supplement without the increase`

§§ `16 -- illustrations`

-- A combined salary of 10,000 with 2001 and 2008 supplements of 300 and
-- 200: 42% of 10,500.
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement for` `the Oz reform in full` 10000 300 200 EQUALS 4410
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement for` `the Oz reform in part` 10000 300 200 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement counts for` `computing the hour value`
#ASSERT NOT `the Oz LaTmura supplement counts for` `computing supplement 2011`
#ASSERT NOT `the Oz LaTmura supplement counts for` `computing the promotion-grade supplement`
#ASSERT NOT `the Oz LaTmura supplement counts for` `contributions to the Dafna fund`
-- Of the six percentage supplements the agreement tells apart, (ב) brings
-- the supplement into the base of one only: the rest, together.
#ASSERT count (filter (GIVEN p YIELD `computing a percentage supplement` p AND `the Oz LaTmura supplement counts for` p) `what an Oz salary component may count for`) EQUALS 1
-- A 1994 supplement of 500 on the eve, 520 since: 520 + 210.
#ASSERT `the 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 16(ג)` `the Oz reform in full` 520 500 EQUALS 730
#ASSERT `the 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 16(ג)` `off the Oz reform` 520 500 EQUALS 520
